   "title": "MP11's quantity, and Rev 9's rivet consolidation",
   "text": "The 1996 row reads 'MP11  RIVET,S-TUB,OVAL,AL,.087,.343  838458' against a Tot Qty of 2 — one designator for two parts. The missing one is MP12: Rev 9 prints 'MP 3- 12' on stock 838482 for a Tot Qty of 10, so it names an MP12 that the 1996 row does not, and no MP19 exists in either list. The 1996 row is treated here as MP11 and MP12, which makes its quantity agree with itself. The revisions then genuinely disagree about the part: 1996 has MP3–MP10 as .250 aluminium rivets and MP11/MP12 as .343 aluminium ones, while Rev 9 has all ten of MP3–MP12 as .250 steel. Both are shown, the 1996 description as the main one and Rev 9's as as-built.",
